BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 495.60 Tm (1. Summary of the signal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 469.20 Tm (Between October 2025 and March 2026 the Unit received thirty-one reports of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 456.00 Tm (dizziness in patients receiving CardioZen. Reports originated from all three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 442.80 Tm (sites and from two community pharmacy partners. Onset was described as within) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 429.60 Tm (the first fortnight of therapy in the majority of reports and as transient in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 416.40 Tm (twenty-four of the thirty-one.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 390.00 Tm (2. Assessment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 363.60 Tm (The Unit assessed the reports for a dose relationship and did not find one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 350.40 Tm (Twelve of the thirty-one reports described concurrent initiation of a second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 337.20 Tm (agent with recognised vestibular effects, which the Unit regards as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 324.00 Tm (plausible alternative explanation in those cases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 297.60 Tm (Laboratory data were available for nineteen of the reported patients. Serum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 284.40 Tm (potassium was within the reference range in seventeen of the nineteen at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 271.20 Tm (time closest to symptom onset, and marginally elevated in two. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 258.00 Tm (electrocardiogram had been recorded in six patients and showed no consistent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 244.80 Tm (abnormality. These figures are presented to characterise the reports; they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 231.60 Tm (describe what happened to be on file and are not a recommendation that either) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 218.40 Tm (investigation be performed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 192.00 Tm (3. Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 165.60 Tm (The Unit's conclusion is that the reports are consistent with a recognised,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 152.40 Tm (usually self-limiting effect of therapy initiation. **No change to laboratory) Tj ET
